  "goodToKnow": "Die Stadtverwaltung is the city administration, the offices that run a town: registration at the Bürgeramt, building permits, parking, waste collection. It's led by the (Ober)bürgermeister, while der Stadtrat (city council) makes the decisions. Die Verwaltung means administration, and German Verwaltung is known for thoroughness and paperwork, though digitalisation (Onlinezugang) is slowly reducing trips to offices. Plural: die Stadtverwaltungen."
